flowchart TD

%% ===== 人类层（你） =====
    A0[👤 创始人 / CEO（你）]:::human

%% ===== 市场与产品阶段 =====
A1[📊 市场调研员<br>AI Market Analyst]:::ai
A2[🎯 产品经理<br>AI Product Manager]:::ai
A3[🏗️ 架构师<br>AI System Architect]:::ai
A4[🧭 项目经理<br>AI Project Manager]:::ai

%% ===== 设计与开发阶段 =====
A5[🎨 UI 工程师<br>AI UI/UX Designer]:::ai
A6[💻 前端工程师<br>AI Frontend Developer]:::ai
A7[⚙️ 后端工程师<br>AI Backend Developer]:::ai
A8[☁️ DevOps 工程师<br>AI DevOps Engineer]:::ai
A12[🧪 测试工程师<br>AI QA Engineer]:::ai

%% ===== 发布与运营阶段 =====
A9[📢 运营 / 销售<br>AI Growth & Sales]:::ai
A10[⚖️ 法务团队<br>AI Legal Advisor]:::ai
A11[💬 售后团队<br>AI Customer Support]:::ai

%% ===== 人类层输出 =====
Z[📈 业务增长 / 产品迭代反馈]:::output

%% ===== 连接关系 =====
A0 --> A1
A1 --> A2
A2 --> A3
A2 --> A5
A3 --> A4
A4 --> A6
A4 --> A7
A5 --> A6
A6 --> A7
A7 --> A8
A7 --> A12
A8 --> A9
A8 --> A11
A9 --> A10
A9 --> A11
A11 --> A2
A11 --> Z
Z --> A0

%% ===== 样式定义 =====
classDef ai fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#999,stroke-width:1px,color:#111,rx:10,ry:10;
classDef human fill:#C6E5FF,stroke:#0369A1,stroke-width:2px,color:#111,font-weight:bold;
classDef output fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#16A34A,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#111;
